# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repo is PUBLIC and GitHub Pages serves its ROOT. A file committed here is
# a live URL, not merely readable source. The store is welcome to be public —
# internal material is not.
#
# Deny by TYPE, never by the name of the last file that leaked
# (merritt-studio/docs/SHARING-PROTOCOL.md, rule 1). Internal documents, QA
# evidence and tool config live in the private studio repo at
# merritt-studio/docs/tenants/plspress-com-pitch/.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# documents and machine-readable config — none of it belongs on a storefront
*.md
*.json
*.jsonc
*.toml
*.yml
*.yaml
*.txt
*.csv
*.log

# dotfiles and dot-directories (.impeccable, .hq, .claude, editor cruft)
.*

# internal working directories
/gate/
/tools/
/src/
/scratch/
/notes/

# ── the storefront itself, re-admitted explicitly ────────────────────────────
!.gitignore
!.nojekyll
!/library/.gitkeep
